{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu10", "cards": [{"id": "u4.t.green-algae", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">GREEN<\/span> <span class=\"st\">AL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gae<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"green algae\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: green algae\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-green-algae.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"532\" alt=\"Spirogyra, a green alga, under a microscope. Its chloroplasts form green spiral ribbons in each cell.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Spirogyra, a green alga, under a microscope. Its chloroplasts form green spiral ribbons in each cell.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的水绵（一种绿藻）。每个细胞里的叶绿体排成绿色螺旋带。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Wiedehopf20 · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_freshwater_alga_Spirogyra.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"green algae\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"85\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"10\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"13\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">red algae<\/text><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"85\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"110\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"60\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">green algae<\/text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"110\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">land plants<\/text><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"47.5\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"47.5\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Algae with chlorophyll that are the closest relatives of land plants.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>绿藻<\/b>：含叶绿素的藻类，是陆地植物最近的亲戚。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">green algae share chlorophyll types with plants.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">绿藻与植物有相同类型的叶绿素。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which algae are the closest relatives of plants?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Green algae.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.slime-mold", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">SLIME<\/span> <span class=\"st\">MOLD<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"slime mold\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: slime mold\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-slime-mold.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" alt=\"The slime mold Physarum polycephalum: a bright yellow mass creeping over wood.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The slime mold Physarum polycephalum: a bright yellow mass creeping over wood.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">多头绒泡菌（一种黏菌）：在木头上缓慢爬行的一团亮黄色物质。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Le Bernemi · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Blob_(Physarum_polycephalum).jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"slime mold\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M30 80 Q40 40 70 55 Q90 20 120 50 Q160 40 165 80 Q120 95 80 88 Q50 100 30 80 Z\" class=\"f6 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">looks like a fungus, but is a protist<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">feeds on dead matter<\/text><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"60\" r=\"3\" class=\"f4\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" class=\"f4\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A protist that feeds on dead matter and can creep like one giant cell.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>黏菌<\/b>：以腐烂物质为食的原生生物，可以像一个巨大的细胞那样爬行。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">slime mold is not a fungus.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黏菌不是真菌。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is a slime mold a fungus?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It is a protist.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.plasmodium", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">plas<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">MO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">di<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">um<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"Plasmodium\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: Plasmodium\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Plasmodium\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Infected<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mosquito<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bites<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"53.6\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Plasmodium<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"62.8\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">enters<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">blood<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Malaria<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The protist that causes malaria. A mosquito carries it between people.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>疟原虫<\/b>：引起疟疾的原生生物，由蚊子在人之间传播。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Plasmodium = a protist, not a bacterium.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">疟原虫是原生生物，不是细菌。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which organism spreads Plasmodium?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The Anopheles mosquito.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.vector", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">VEC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tor<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"vector\" data-audio=\"audio/vector.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: vector\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"vector\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"30\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"14\" class=\"f1\"/><path d=\"M55 60 L145 60\" class=\"s\"/><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"135.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"135.0,60.0 130.5,62.2 130.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><ellipse cx=\"170\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"14\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">host 1<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mosquito = vector<\/text><text x=\"170\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">host 2<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism that carries a pathogen from one host to another.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>媒介生物<\/b>：把病原体从一个宿主带到另一个宿主的生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">vector = Latin for carrier.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">vector 在拉丁语里是「搬运者」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name a vector of malaria.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">A mosquito.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.mixotroph", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">MIX<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">troph<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"mixotroph\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: mixotroph\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mixotroph\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Makes food<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">photosynthesis in<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">light<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Eats food<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">engulfs prey when<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">needed<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism that can both make its own food and eat other organisms.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>混合营养生物<\/b>：既能自己制造食物、又能摄食其他生物的生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">mixo = mixed, troph = feeding.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">mixo = 混合。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Why is euglena called a mixotroph?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">It can photosynthesize and eat.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.colonial-organism", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">co<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ni<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">al<\/span> <span class=\"st\">OR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gan<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ism<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"colonial organism\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: colonial organism\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-colonial-organism.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Volvox under a microscope. Each green ball is a colony of hundreds of cells; small daughter colonies grow inside.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Volvox under a microscope. Each green ball is a colony of hundreds of cells; small daughter colonies grow inside.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的团藻。每个绿球是由数百个细胞组成的群体，里面还长着小的子群体。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Frank Fox · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/de/deed.en\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 3.0 de<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mikrofoto.de-volvox-4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"colonial organism\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"40\" r=\"14\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"40\" r=\"14\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"40\" r=\"14\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"66\" r=\"14\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"66\" r=\"14\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"92\" r=\"14\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Volvox: a colony of cells<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A group of single cells living together, each able to survive alone.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>群体生物<\/b>：一群生活在一起的单细胞，每个细胞都能独立生存。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">colony = a group living together.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">colony = 群体。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: How is a colony different from a multicellular organism?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Each cell can live on its own.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u4.t.green-algae", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Algae with chlorophyll that are the closest relatives of land plants.”<\/i>", "opts": ["eyespot", "green algae", "photosynthesis", "food vacuole"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>green algae<\/b>: Algae with chlorophyll that are the closest relatives of land plants. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">绿藻<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.slime-mold", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A protist that feeds on dead matter and can creep like one giant cell.”<\/i>", "opts": ["colonial organism", "flagellate", "plankton", "slime mold"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>slime mold<\/b>: A protist that feeds on dead matter and can creep like one giant cell. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黏菌<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.plasmodium", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The protist that causes malaria. A mosquito carries it between people.”<\/i>", "opts": ["contractile vacuole", "Plasmodium", "cilia", "algae"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>Plasmodium<\/b>: The protist that causes malaria. A mosquito carries it between people. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">疟原虫<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.vector", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism that carries a pathogen from one host to another.”<\/i>", "opts": ["vector", "flagellate", "amoeba", "zooplankton"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>vector<\/b>: An organism that carries a pathogen from one host to another. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">媒介生物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.mixotroph", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism that can both make its own food and eat other organisms.”<\/i>", "opts": ["chloroplast", "mixotroph", "vector", "cilia"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>mixotroph<\/b>: An organism that can both make its own food and eat other organisms. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">混合营养生物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.colonial-organism", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A group of single cells living together, each able to survive alone.”<\/i>", "opts": ["algae", "colonial organism", "dinoflagellate", "mitochondrion"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>colonial organism<\/b>: A group of single cells living together, each able to survive alone. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">群体生物<\/span>", "whys": null}]}